@prefix zhang2013: <https://w3id.org/claim-chain/doi10.1016-j.commatsci.2013.07.012/> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix claimchain: <https://w3id.org/claim-chain/schema/> .
